Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道那个人是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go say goodbye to the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我要去跟男生们道别
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:16.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know what? Tell them that bone story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:16.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他们说化石的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I have to go to China. - The country?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我得去中国（亦指瓷器）一趟 - 你是说那个国家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, this big pile of dishes in my Mom's breakfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}错，是我妈橱柜上的那堆碗盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you guys know who Carl is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道卡尔是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. Alvin, Simon, Theodore...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想想，艾尔文、赛门、席尔多…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:39.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:39.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:43.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, Rachel's having drinks with him. - Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:43.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋今晚跟他去喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can she, when she's never shown interest in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎么可以这样？ 而且对你一点兴趣也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}忘了她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's right, man. Please move on. Go to China. Eat Chinese food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说得对，你要忘了她，快点去中国吧 去吃些好吃的中国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, there they just call it food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然中国人不会说 自己吃的是〝中国菜〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:06:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? I guess. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:06:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大概吧，我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:05.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, just give her this for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:05.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，那就帮我 把这个交给她，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, we're just looking out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄，我们是为了你好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I know. - We want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我知道 - 希望你能开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:13.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I may only have a couple beers in me, but I love you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:13.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我喝了点啤酒 可是我是爱你的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm still on my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还在喝第一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think you're nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:33.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, that's when me and my friends started this fruit-basket business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:33.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是那时候开始 经营水果篮生意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We call ourselves "The Three Basketeers." Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们称自己为 〝篮子三剑客〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like "The Three Musketeers," only with fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是〝三剑客〞加上水果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How do you like your burgers? - No. Presents first, food later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们的汉堡肉要多熟？ - 不…先拆礼物！食物等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on there, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，小老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How's it going? How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吧？还撑得下去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:58.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:58.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She thinks tonight's the night we're gonna complete the transaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她以为我们今晚会进展到全垒打的地步…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:03.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if you know what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:03.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…如果你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:05.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you do. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:05.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…你知道的嘛，呵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:09.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, have you ever thought about being there for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:09.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有想过 就陪在她身边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, just be there for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 就是单纯的陪伴在她身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听不懂耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好好想想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm guessing this is from...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这个是来自…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, thank you, Melanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅兰妮，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay, this one right here is from me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好的，这个是我送的 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm. Ah, it's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，好，很轻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It rattles. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有沙沙声，是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Travel Scrabble. - Ha, ha, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 拼字游戏随身包  - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one's from Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是乔伊送的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It feels like a book. I think it's a book. Feels like a book. And it's a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉像是书 应该是书 真的是一本书
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Dr. Seuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是《苏西博士》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That book got me through some tough times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那本书伴我度过 许多艰困的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is a little child inside this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这男人心中住着一个小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The doctors say if they remove it, he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生说如果把孩子从他身体里拿走 他会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who's this from? - That's, uh, Ross'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这是谁送的 - 是罗斯送的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还记得！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remembered what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was, like, months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是几个月前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:45.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were walking by this antique store, and I saw this pin in the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:45.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们经过一家骨董店 我看到这枚胸针
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told him it was just like one my grandmother had when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟他说这枚胸针 跟我小时候奶奶的胸针很像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:52.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aw! I can't believe he remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:52.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 他竟然还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:56.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, sure, but can you play it on a plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:56.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你能在飞机上玩那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好美喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This must've cost him a fortune. - I can't believe he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 定花了他很多钱 - 真是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross? Remember when he fell in love with Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:09.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们记得上大学时 罗斯爱上卡萝…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and bought her that ridiculously expensive crystal duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}买给她一个超贵的水晶鸭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:15.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:15.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Crystal duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}水晶鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:39.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The, um... The "love" part?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:39.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爱上卡萝的那段
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不、不、不
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:54.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's good. Just keep rubbing your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:54.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 继续抓头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That'll turn back time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样就可以收回你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is unbelievable. I mean, this is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真是太难以置信了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:08.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. This is really, really huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:08.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 这真是超级大条的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:13.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's not. It's small, it's tiny, it's petite, it's wee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:13.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，这是小事 微不足道的超级小事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-uh. I don't think any of our lives will ever be the same ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的生活从此面临巨大转变
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there a mute button on this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想办法让这女人闭嘴好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think this is so great! I mean, you and Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得这样很棒 你跟罗斯在一起很棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did you have any idea? - No, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你之前知道吗  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My first night in the city, he mentioned asking me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到纽约的第一个晚上 他说过要约我出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but nothing ever happened, so I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是一直都没有发生 所以我以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What else did he say? Does he want to go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还说了什么 他有说想跟我约会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Given that he's desperately in love with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他既然那么爱你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he wouldn't mind getting a cup of coffee or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不介意跟你喝杯咖啡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:49.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:49.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一直都喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I've gotta talk to him. - He's in China!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我得去找他谈谈  - 他人在中国（亦指瓷器）啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他指的是国家喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, his flight doesn't leave for 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 他的班机四十五分钟后才起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:11:00.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the time difference? From here to the airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:11:00.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那时差呢 - 从这儿到机场的时差
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're never gonna make it! - I've got to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你赶不及的  - 我总得试试
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:07.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you gonna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:07.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你要对他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you shouldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你就不该去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, because if you're gonna break his heart, that can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 如果你是去伤他的心 那就不用急于一时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:16.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but if it's good news, tell him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但如果是好消息 那就马上去告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I'll know when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞不好等我看到他就会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, look. All right, does this help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，这样有帮助吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I know is, I cannot wait a week. This is just too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只知道我等不了一个礼拜 这件事太让人震撼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've just got to talk to him. I've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得跟他谈谈，我得…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll see you later. - I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 待会儿见了 - 瑞秋，我爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Deal with me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先跟我谈啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:54.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:54.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:56.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING CHINESE]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:56.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross! Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯！罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯 不好意思 借过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. Your boarding pass? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨，您的登机证呢  - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I need to talk to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有登机证 我只是有事得跟我朋友谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:10.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, you're not allowed on the jetway unless you have a boarding pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:10.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 没有登机证就无法进去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just went on. He's right there, in the blue jacket! Can I just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 他刚进去 就在那里 穿蓝色外套的那个 我可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Federal regulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，这是联邦法律规定！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:20.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, um, then could you please just give him a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:20.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，那你可以帮我传话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please? This is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，我有重要的事跟他说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. What's the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me! Sir! Excuse me! Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思，先生、先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I have a message for you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有人请我传话给你 - 是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's from Rachel. She loved the present. She'll see you when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋说她很喜欢你送的礼物 她会等你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Toby, I don't know what she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}托碧 我不知道她在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:45.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:45.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有瑞秋这个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't give me that deep freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要跟我冷战
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:01.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Joey, Joey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:01.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，乔伊、乔伊、乔伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I blacked out there for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我刚失去了知觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不算什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now we gotta find something fun for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在换你享受罗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget about me. Let's, uh... Let's give you another turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:23.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别管我了 你再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何不可
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:37.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy! Somebody's gonna get a big fruit basket tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:37.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，有人明天 会拿到一个超大的水果篮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:47.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta tell you, you are nothing like I thought you would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:47.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说，乔伊 你跟我想像中的完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just had you pegged as one of those guys who are always, "Me, me, me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你是 凡事只想到自己的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ha, ha. - But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哈哈 - 可是你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're a giver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}竟然这么替别人着想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're, like, the most generous man I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我碰过最大方体贴的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you're practically a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你根本就是个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, Rach, do you want to save this wrapping paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋 你要把包装纸留起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's only a little torn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有点破
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you gonna go for it with Ross, or should I throw it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想跟罗斯在一起吗 还是我该把这东西给丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道、我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thought about it all of the way there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去的时候一直在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I thought about it all the way back and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回来的时候也一直想…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}竟然是罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I mean? It's Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道我的意思吗 我跟罗斯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sure! - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是啊！ - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:43.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. This is just my initial gut feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:43.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 我的直觉告诉我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it'd be really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样应该会很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:51.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, me too! Oh, we'd be like friends-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:51.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，我也这样觉得耶！ 我们会变成朋友兼亲家！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The best part is you already know everything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最棒的是 你对他已经很了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like starting on the 15th date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉就像第十五次约会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it would be like starting on the 15th date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，一开始就像 已经约会十五次了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说的好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At the 15th date, you're already in a "relationship-y" place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常约会到第十五次 双方就应该已经在交往
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定要在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happens if it doesn't work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果事情不成怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:22.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why isn't it working out? - I don't know, sometimes it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:22.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么会不成？ - 不知道，有时候就是会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is he not cute enough for you? Does he not make enough money?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不够帅吗？ 还是赚的钱不够多？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, I'm just... - Maybe there's someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不是啦，我只是… - 也许她有别的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there? Is there someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你还有别的对象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:34.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, there is no one else. - Then why the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有啊，没有别人 - 那你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...are you dumping my brother?  - Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甩掉我哥？  - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, big... - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，大… - 嘘！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慈善家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So how'd it go? - It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 结果怎样？ - 太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how you think you're great in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道那种自认很行的感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The fact you'd even ask shows how little you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会问我那种问题 就代表你根本不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's like, last night I couldn't do the thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚我没办法表现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that usually makes me great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿手的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I had to do all this other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我只好想别的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the response I got! Man, oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果我得到的回应超赞的！ 老兄，不是我想自夸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was like a ticker-tape parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好像去参加碎纸花游行一样开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:22.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes I know. As it happens, my room is very close to the parade route.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:22.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，我房间 离游行路线非常非常近
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was amazing, and not just for her. Uh-uh. For me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那种感觉真的很棒，不只是她 我也觉得超赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:35.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like, all of a sudden, I'm blind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:35.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那种感觉就像是 我突然间看不见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but all my other senses are heightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是其他的感官却都变敏锐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know? It's like, I was able to appreciate it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像可以体会到…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一种层次的喜悦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know you had another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你还有层次可言
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. Neither did I!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，我之前也不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, great skirts! Birthday present? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，这件裙子真漂亮 是你的生日礼物吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- From who? - From you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁送的？ - 你送的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I exchanged the blouse you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把你送的衬衫拿去换了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心意最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't Ross' flight get in in a couple hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯的班机不是快到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At gate 27B?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得是在登机门二十七B
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, you know, I've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我想了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:25.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've decided this Ross thing is not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:25.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得我不该跟罗斯在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why? - Because I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么？ - 因为我会觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:30.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...like I wouldn't just be going out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:30.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不只是在跟他交往
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would be going out with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们大家都会变成我约会的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ugh, there'd be all this pressure and... - No pressure, no pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我会有压力… - 没有压力、没有压力的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing has even happened yet and you're already so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我们八字都还没一撇 你就已经这么…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not "so."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪有！好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was a teensy bit weird at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始我是觉得有点怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'll be good. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是我发誓不会给你们压力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CARL: It's me, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我，卡尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:59.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Behind my brother's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:59.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你背着我哥偷吃？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is the kind of crazy thing you won't be hearing from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像这种话 我绝不可能会对你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Seven hundred bucks. - All right, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 七百块！ - 太棒了！你办到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do we have any fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家里有水果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man, hell of a two weeks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是可怕的两个礼拜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:31.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what, though? I really feel I learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？ 我觉得我从中学到很多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you'll stick with this "it's all for her" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还要继续 〝凡事以她为主〞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:36.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:36.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When a blind man gets his sight back, does he walk around like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 个盲人恢复视觉之后 还会这样走路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just saying, if I see one more picture of Ed Begley Jr...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是说 如果再让我看到…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in that stupid electric car...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾德贝格利在电动车里的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm gonna shoot myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就会自杀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:59.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't get me wrong. I'm not against environmental issues, per se...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:59.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我并不是反对环保…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's just that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是讨厌那个家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:05.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you'd rather go out with him than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:05.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到你竟然宁愿跟他出去 而不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, please. I'm trying to have a date here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我正在约会耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, just stop thinking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，那就停止想我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't do it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做不到是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm thinking about you. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是在想你，那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't get it. What do you see in this guy anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂 这个男人到底哪里好？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:27.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he seems to be a very nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:27.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他似乎是一个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:31.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, come on, buddy! Get a real car!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:31.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托！你好歹也买部真正的车吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:37.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, come on. Give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:37.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，给我们一个机会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross, it's too hard. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，这对我来说太难了 - 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it'll get weird for everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？因为大家会觉得很怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares about them? This is about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会在乎啊？这是我们两人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been in love with you since the ninth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从国三就开始喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:51.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're, like, my best friend. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:51.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，你算是我最好的朋友 - 我了解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- If we broke up, and I lost you... - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 如果我们分手、而我失去你的话… - 喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you think we'll break up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么会这么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:59.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you been involved with someone where you haven't broken up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:59.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有谈过没分手的恋爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:03.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:03.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it only has to happen once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是这种事只需要发生一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and I know we are perfect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:11.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都知道我们是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So the only question is: Are you attracted to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以唯一的问题是 你喜欢我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I've never looked at you that way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从来没把你看成恋爱对象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就从现在开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you just know I'm gonna be the guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个白痴会害我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:45.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...caught behind this hammerhead in traffic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:45.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}塞在车阵中的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Right. - Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 呵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对！你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你知道吗？ - 啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot, I'm supposed to pick up a friend at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚想到我得去机场接朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am so sorry. I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:02.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want to stay and finish your drinks, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:02.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想 留在这里把这喝完，请自便
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I gotta go. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我得走了，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me! Pardon me! Excuse me.
