Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Toby, for God's sake, will you let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}托碧，拜托 你别这样好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本没有瑞秋这个女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, hey. I got that. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿！我来拿 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thanks, sweetie. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谢谢，甜心 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot wait for you to meet my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我等不及要把你介绍给朋友们
