Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 就是等不及！呵 - 就是等不及！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:51.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, they're gonna love you.
